earch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4386173159", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/17009#issuecomment-4386173159", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/17009", "id": 4386173159, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABBW-w5w", "user": {"login": "gswazai889", "id": 271464602, "node_id": "U_kgDOEC44mg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271464602?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889", "html_url": "https://github.com/gswazai889", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gswazai889/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-05-06T08:10:03Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-06T08:10:03Z", "body": "Run this to fix the Maturin issue. \n# Update current packages\npkg update && pkg upgrade\n\n# Install Rust, Cargo, and essential build tools\npkg install rust binutils build-essential pkg-config openssl openssl-tool python-pip\n\n# Sometimes required for Rust crates compiling on Termux\nexport CARGO_BUILD_TARGET=aarch64-linux-android", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4386173159/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4952388039", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/17009#issuecomment-4952388039", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/17009", "id": 4952388039, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABJy9xxw", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-07-12T19:03:20Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-12T19:03:20Z", "body": "<!-- hermes-sweeper:item=17009 -->\n<!-- hermes-sweeper:verdict=close reason=implemented_on_main confidence=high -->\nThis is now implemented on main. Automated hermes-sweeper review found a dedicated Termux path covering the later-reported maturin and filesystem-artifact failure modes.\n\n- `scripts/install.sh:1367-1407` detects Termux, supplies `ANDROID_API_LEVEL`, and uses `.[termux-all]` with `.[termux]`/base fallbacks instead of desktop extras.\n- `hermes_cli/main.py:9907-9947` makes `hermes update` select the curated `termux-all` dependency group on Termux.\n- `tools/environments/local.py:936-982` uses writable `TMPDIR` instead of assuming `/tmp`; `tests/tools/test_local_tempdir.py:7-50` covers the Termux path.\n- The implementation is present in `d682f320b35a13084371a541a835e1d988c982b8`, shipped no later than `v2026.7.1`.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4952388039/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]